{"id": "45", "question": "What kind of hat is the man wearing?", "gt": "The man is not wearing a hat.", "pred": "The man is not wearing a hat.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The man is not wearing a hat.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe man is not wearing a hat.\nThe man's head is fully visible in the image.\nThe man's head is clearly visible and appears to be bald or closely shaven. There is no visible covering on the top of his head. Therefore, it can be concluded that he is not wearing a hat.\n\nThe man is not wearing a hat.", "time_sec": 169.227, "generation_time_seconds": 103.8213, "selection_time_seconds": 65.3758, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 100.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "46", "question": "What color is the astronaut's eyes?", "gt": "the astronaut's eyes aren't visible", "pred": "The color of the astronaut's eyes is not visible.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The color of the astronaut's eyes is not visible.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the image provided, the astronaut's helmet visor completely obscures their eyes. The visor itself is dark, and no light or reflection from the eyes is visible.\nThe visor's dark tint and reflective surface prevent any view of the astronaut's eyes. There is no visible light source or reflection indicating the color of the eyes.\nThe astronaut is wearing a full-face helmet with a dark, reflective visor. The visor's surface is smooth and highly reflective, creating a mirror-like effect that obscures anything behind it. In the provided image, there are no discernible reflections, glints, or light sources within the visor that would reveal the color of the eyes. The visor itself appears to be a single, non-transparent dark surface.\n\nThe color of the astronaut's eyes is not visible.", "time_sec": 218.111, "generation_time_seconds": 144.926, "selection_time_seconds": 73.1802, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 66.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "48", "question": "What kind of insect is the tarantula eating?", "gt": "The tarantula is not eating an insect.", "pred": "Based on the visual information in the image, the tarantula is not eating an insect. It is positioned over and appears to be consuming a human hand.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Based on the visual information in the image, the tarantula is not eating an insect. It is positioned over and appears to be consuming a human hand.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the visual information provided in the image, the large spider, which appears to be a tarantula, is positioned over and seemingly consuming a human hand. The object being eaten is part of the person who is lying on the bed next to the spider.\nThe object being consumed by the tarantula is an appendage, specifically a hand, which is attached to a human arm. It is not an insect or any other type of creature.\nThe object being consumed by the tarantula has the distinct features of a human hand, including visible fingers and a palm. It is not an insect but rather part of a human being. Therefore, the tarantula is not eating an insect.\n\nBased on the visual information in the image, the tarantula is not eating an insect. It is positioned over and appears to be consuming a human hand.", "time_sec": 282.469, "generation_time_seconds": 150.8535, "selection_time_seconds": 131.5915, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "50", "question": "What kind of fruit is used as the perch in the image?", "gt": "There are no fruit present in the image.", "pred": "Based on the visual evidence, the object used as the perch is a cluster of small, round, and soft-looking fruits. This appearance is characteristic of a mulberry.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Based on the visual evidence, the object used as the perch is a cluster of small, round, and soft-looking fruits. This appearance is characteristic of a mulberry.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe object used as the perch is a dense cluster of small, round, and fluffy-looking items.\nBased on the provided image, the object used as the perch is a cluster of small, round, and fluffy-looking items. This description is consistent with the appearance of certain fruits, specifically those that are small, spherical, and covered in fine hairs or fuzz, such as mulberries or certain types of elderberries. The visual evidence points to a fruit cluster with this texture and shape rather than any other category like nuts or larger fruits. Therefore, the next step in the reasoning is to consider fruits that match this physical description.\nThe cluster of fruits on the perch is composed of numerous small, round, and soft-looking drupes. These are held together in a dense aggregate that gives them a fluffy appearance. This is characteristic of a composite fruit, specifically one that develops from a cluster of small flowers on a single receptacle. The specific fruit that fits this description is the mulberry. Mulberries grow in clusters during their season and are known for their soft, juicy texture and round shape, although they can appear fuzzy. The image shows a very detailed and stylized representation of this, so the fruit used as the perch is most likely a mulberry.\n\nBased on the visual evidence, the object used as the perch is a cluster of small, round, and soft-looking fruits. This appearance is characteristic of a mulberry.", "time_sec": 405.73, "generation_time_seconds": 174.3751, "selection_time_seconds": 231.2988, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "51", "question": "What color is the clothing that the frog is wearing?", "gt": "There is no frog in this image.", "pred": "The animal in the image is a cat, not a frog. The cat is wearing a light pink robe with floral patterns.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The animal in the image is a cat, not a frog. The cat is wearing a light pink robe with floral patterns.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe animal depicted in the image is a cat, not a frog. The clothing the cat is wearing is light pink in color.\nThe image does not contain a frog. The animal present is a cat. The cat is wearing a garment that is light pink with some floral patterns.\nThe garment worn by the animal in the image is a traditional robe. Upon close inspection, the base color of the robe is a pale pink. It has a subtle pattern of flowers and other designs that appear to be in a slightly darker shade of pink, giving it depth.\n\nThe animal in the image is a cat, not a frog. The cat is wearing a light pink robe with floral patterns.", "time_sec": 241.73, "generation_time_seconds": 131.244, "selection_time_seconds": 110.4532, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "52", "question": "What color is the hair tie the man is using?", "gt": "The man is not using any hair ties.", "pred": "The color of the hair tie is orange or gold.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The color of the hair tie is orange or gold.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the visual information provided in the image, the man's hair is styled in a spiky fashion. This style is held together by a hair tie. The hair tie is located at the base of the man's neck and is clearly visible.\nThe man's hair is styled upwards, with the lower section gathered and secured. A band is used to hold this section in place. This band is a solid, circular object. Its surface reflects light, showing a metallic texture and a warm, glowing color that appears to be orange or gold.\nThe object in question is a hair tie located at the base of the man's neck.\n It is not a simple elastic band but a more substantial, decorative accessory.\n The material appears to be metallic or a similar shiny substance.\n Its color is a warm, luminous orange or gold, which contrasts with the more neutral tones of the man's armor and skin.\n\nBased on the visual information provided in the image, the man's hair is styled in a spiky fashion. This style is held together by a hair tie located at the base of his neck. The hair tie is clearly visible and appears to be made of a metallic or shiny material. Its color is a warm, luminous orange or gold, which gives it a glowing appearance.\n\nThe color of the hair tie is orange or gold.", "time_sec": 301.42, "generation_time_seconds": 176.179, "selection_time_seconds": 125.2063, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
