{"id": "56", "question": "What is the color of the bench in the image?", "gt": "There are no benches in the image.", "pred": "A bench is not present in the image.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A bench is not present in the image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nObserving the seating area in the image, the objects are individual seats with armrests, not a continuous bench. These seats appear to have a dark blue or teal color. Since the primary seating structure is composed of separate seats rather than a single bench, there is no distinct color for a bench visible in the image.\nThe image displays a large seating area consistent with a theater or auditorium. The seating consists of numerous individual chairs arranged in rows, each with its own armrest. There is no continuous bench structure visible in the image. Therefore, it is not possible to determine a color for a bench as one is not present.\nThe image shows rows of individual seats, which are characteristic of an auditorium or theater. These seats are not connected to form a single, continuous bench. As no bench is visible in the image, the question cannot be answered.\n\nA bench is not present in the image.", "time_sec": 227.09, "generation_time_seconds": 160.9676, "selection_time_seconds": 66.091, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 28.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "57", "question": "What object is the subject holding in his right hand?", "gt": "The subject is not holding an object in his right hand.", "pred": "The subject's right hand is resting on the armrest of the throne and is not holding any separate object.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The subject's right hand is resting on the armrest of the throne and is not holding any separate object.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on a close examination of the image, the subject's right hand is not holding any separate object. The hand is resting on the armrest of the ornate chair on which the figure is seated. The fingers are curled, but there is nothing held between them or in the palm. Therefore, the object in the subject's right hand is the chair armrest itself.\nThe subject's right hand is positioned on the arm of the throne. Upon close inspection, the hand is not grasping any distinct, separate item. Instead, the hand is placed directly on the armrest of the chair.\nLooking closely at the subject's right hand, the fingers are curled, but they are not encircling or holding any object. The hand is resting on a large, ornate, and upholstered armrest of a throne. The armrest appears to be a continuous part of the chair's structure, with intricate carvings and fabric, and there is no other object visible within the hand or being supported by it.\n\nThe subject's right hand is resting on the armrest of the throne and is not holding any separate object.", "time_sec": 243.463, "generation_time_seconds": 180.2236, "selection_time_seconds": 63.2101, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "59", "question": "What color is the moon in the image?", "gt": "No moon is visible in the image.", "pred": "The moon is not present in the image.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The moon is not present in the image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe moon is not present in the image.\nThe image depicts a floating island with buildings, trees, and a cloudy sky. Upon close inspection of the sky in the background, there is no visible moon present. Therefore, the moon cannot be assigned a color as it is not depicted in the scene.\nThe image contains a sky that is mostly filled with clouds. There are no celestial bodies such as the moon or stars visible within the sky area. The lighting in the scene appears to be from a diffuse, ambient source rather than a direct source like the sun or moon. Therefore, no moon is present in the image.\n\nThe moon is not present in the image.", "time_sec": 241.448, "generation_time_seconds": 135.3272, "selection_time_seconds": 106.0886, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "60", "question": "What type of hat is the fox in this image wearing?", "gt": "The fox does not have a hat in this image.", "pred": "Based on the image provided, the fox is not wearing a hat.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Based on the image provided, the fox is not wearing a hat.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the image provided, the fox character is not wearing a hat. The analysis of the character's head shows the following:\nThe fox character in the image has prominent, pointed ears with black tips and visible inner ear fur. The top of the head is covered with orange fur that blends into the rest of the character's body. There is no object on the head that could be identified as a hat; the character's headwear consists solely of its natural fur and ears.\nThe character's head is fully covered by its natural fur, which is orange on the head and neck, with a white ruff of fur around the chin and neck area. There are no additional accessories, such as a hat, headband, or any other object, on the head. The character has no visible headwear.\n\nBased on the image provided, the fox is not wearing a hat.", "time_sec": 214.998, "generation_time_seconds": 145.4705, "selection_time_seconds": 69.5065, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 61.54, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "Is the cheetah's necklace gold or silver?", "gt": "The cheetah in the image is not wearing a necklace.", "pred": "The cheetah is not wearing a necklace.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The cheetah is not wearing a necklace.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe cheetah in the image is not wearing a necklace. There is no visible accessory around its neck.\nThe cheetah's neck is covered by a red, flowing garment that drapes over its shoulders. This garment completely obscures the area where a necklace would be located, and there are no visible accessories or chains around its neck.\nBased on the visual evidence, the cheetah is not wearing a necklace. A prominent red garment covers its entire neck and shoulders, leaving no part of the neck visible. The question of whether a necklace is gold or silver cannot be answered because no such accessory is present or visible in the image.\n\nThe cheetah is not wearing a necklace.", "time_sec": 267.688, "generation_time_seconds": 135.2559, "selection_time_seconds": 132.4057, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 88.89, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "64", "question": "What color are the stars in the image?", "gt": "There are no stars in the image.", "pred": "Stars are not visible in the image.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Stars are not visible in the image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image depicts a large, vertical, and somewhat futuristic or fantastical cityscape with numerous buildings stacked on terraces along the sides of a cliff or canyon. There is a significant amount of fog or mist in the air, which obscures the upper portion of the scene. Upon careful examination of the misty area where stars would typically be visible, there is no clear indication of any stars. The upper part of the image consists of fog, light, and the tops of the structures. Therefore, there is no evidence of stars being present in the image.\nThe image was analyzed to determine the presence of stars. The scene is dominated by a vertical cityscape, with buildings arranged on terraces along a cliff face. The atmosphere is hazy with fog or mist, and the lighting appears to be diffuse, resembling that of an overcast day or a foggy dawn/dusk. The upper portion of the image, where stars would be visible at night, is filled with this fog and does not contain any distinct points of light that could be identified as stars. Therefore, it can be concluded that the stars are not visible in the image.\nThe image was analyzed for the presence of stars. The scene is set in a foggy or misty environment, which significantly obscures the sky. The lighting in the upper portion of the image is diffuse and bright, lacking the contrast necessary to reveal stars against a dark sky. There are no small, bright points of light scattered across the foggy background that would be characteristic of stars. Therefore, based on the visual evidence, stars are not visible in the image.\n\nStars are not visible in the image.", "time_sec": 319.277, "generation_time_seconds": 192.2642, "selection_time_seconds": 126.961, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 57.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "66", "question": "What color is the hair of the man driving the car?", "gt": "No man can be seen driving the car.", "pred": "Based on the provided image, the color of the man's hair is not discernible. The artistic style is pixelated and low-resolution, and the man's head is partially obscured by the car's roof and interior, making it impossible to determine the specific color of his hair.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Based on the provided image, the color of the man's hair is not discernible. The artistic style is pixelated and low-resolution, and the man's head is partially obscured by the car's roof and interior, making it impossible to determine the specific color of his hair.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a pixel art depiction of a scene featuring a shark attacking a city. A man is visible inside the car in the lower right corner, driving. However, due to the artistic style and the perspective, the man's head is partially obscured by the car's roof and the angle. The details of his hair, including its color, are not visible or discernible. Therefore, it is not possible to determine the color of the man's hair based on the image.\nThe man is inside a car, and only the top of his head and shoulders are visible above the dashboard. The perspective is from the front and slightly above, which means the back of his head is not visible. In the pixel art style, the details of his hair are highly stylized and lack fine resolution. The pixels that make up his head are primarily shaded in dark tones, but it is not possible to determine a specific hair color from this limited and abstract representation.\nThe image is a work of art created in a pixelated, low-resolution style. This artistic choice often simplifies and abstracts details to convey an idea rather than provide realistic textures. In this style, the man's hair is composed of a few blocks of dark pixels, lacking the detail necessary to determine its specific color. The view of his head is also limited, as it is framed by the car's interior and roof, which further obscures it. No information in the image provides a clear indication of the man's hair color.\n\nBased on the provided image, the color of the man's hair is not discernible. The artistic style is pixelated and low-resolution, and the man's head is partially obscured by the car's roof and interior, making it impossible to determine the specific color of his hair.", "time_sec": 428.308, "generation_time_seconds": 191.8633, "selection_time_seconds": 236.3288, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "67", "question": "What color is the knight in the top left box's sword?", "gt": "He has no sword.", "pred": "The sword is black.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The sword is black.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe knight in the top left box is depicted holding a sword. The sword is rendered in the same black ink as the rest of the illustration.\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe illustration in the top left box is a black-and-white line drawing. All the details, including the knight and the sword he is holding, are created using black ink on a white background.\nObserving the top left box of the stamp, the knight is holding a sword in his right hand. The entire image is a line art illustration, which uses black lines on a white background to create the image. The sword, along with the knight's armor and the horse, is depicted entirely in black ink with no color fill.\n\nThe sword is black.", "time_sec": 220.223, "generation_time_seconds": 136.0392, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1402, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "70", "question": "Is the cactus green or brown?", "gt": "There is no cactus in the image.", "pred": "Based on the visual information in the image, the cactus plants in the background appear to be brown.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Based on the visual information in the image, the cactus plants in the background appear to be brown.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image contains cactus plants in the background desert landscape.\nUpon examining the cactus plants in the background of the desert landscape, they appear as low-lying shrubs with thin, spiky branches.\nObserving the coloration of the cactus plants in the background, they possess a dull, dusty hue that blends with the arid sand and soil around them.\n\nBased on the visual information in the image, the cactus plants in the background appear to be brown.", "time_sec": 250.918, "generation_time_seconds": 104.0957, "selection_time_seconds": 146.6945, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.77, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
