{"id": "72", "question": "What color is the child's left earring?", "gt": "The child's left ear is not visible so the color of the left earring cannot be determined", "pred": "The child's left earring is not visible.", "group_key": "insufficient context", "sub_category": "insufficient context", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The child's left earring is not visible.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe child is depicted with long hair that covers their left ear. Due to the positioning of the hair and the angle of the figure, the left ear is completely obscured from view. Therefore, it is not possible to determine the color of any earring that might be present.\nThe child is wearing a T-shirt and shorts. The T-shirt is a light, muted pink or light orange color. There is no visible earring on the child's left ear as it is covered by their hair.\nThe child's hair is long and falls over their left ear, completely obscuring it from view. As the ear is not visible, the color of any earring cannot be determined.\n\nThe child's left earring is not visible.", "time_sec": 222.348, "generation_time_seconds": 138.1552, "selection_time_seconds": 84.1726, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 62.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
