lted down, making their facial expression unreadable. There are no visible tears on their face.", "time_sec": 237.172, "generation_time_seconds": 169.8243, "selection_time_seconds": 67.3326, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.17, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
