{"id": "160", "question": "How many cats are in the image?", "gt": "We can not see any cats in the image; No cats can be seen in the image; There are no cats in the image", "pred": "There are 0 cats in the image.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "There are 0 cats in the image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUpon close inspection of the image, there are no visible animals or figures that can be identified as cats. The scene depicts a dimly lit, narrow alleyway with urban structures, illuminated by neon lights. The presence of plants in pots and various wall fixtures is noticeable, but no feline forms or features are discernible. Therefore, based on the visible elements within the image, the count of cats is zero.\nThe image displays a scene of an alleyway. Within this scene, there are several objects such as plants in pots, illuminated signs, and architectural details. Despite the detailed depiction of the environment, there is no animal that can be identified as a cat. The absence of any feline form or silhouette confirms that no cats are present. This leads to the conclusion that the number of cats is zero.\nUpon close inspection of the image, there are no visible animals or figures that can be identified as cats. The scene depicts a dimly lit, narrow alleyway with urban structures, illuminated by neon lights. The presence of plants in pots and various wall fixtures is noticeable, but no feline forms or features are discernible.\n\nThere are 0 cats in the image.", "time_sec": 202.559, "generation_time_seconds": 137.5537, "selection_time_seconds": 64.9772, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.05, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
